OL,3,GNEWSAMP demands action after
OL,4,Aclosed-down dump continues to smell
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called for the government to
OL,7,Fclear a waste dump which is still
OL,8,Femitting a foul smelly odour despite it
OL,9,Fbeing officially closed down.
OL,11,FThe waste heap on the Simonswood
OL,12,FIndustrial Estate has has been the
OL,13,Fsubject of a raft of complaints from
OL,14,Fneighbouring residents in Kirkby,
OL,15,FMerseyside, and Bickerstaffe,
OL,16,FLancashire.
OL,18,FNeighbours have complained of "putrid"
OL,19,Fsmells as well as noise, dirt and dust
OL,20,Ffrom the Bickerstaffe site which has
OL,21,Fbeen shut by the Environment Agency.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
