OL,3,GNEWSAMP demands action after
OL,4,Aclosed-down dump continues to smell
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Lancashire MP Ashley Dalton told
OL,7,Fthe House of Commons: "The mound
OL,8,Fremains, as does the odour and the
OL,9,Fdust."
